<p>The final line is something I went out of my way to work in there, because it's the most direct hint to one of the main unstated mysteries about this SCP. Everything the woman said in the document I posted in this thread is worded very specifically to hint at her nature, her morals, and the intended goal of what she did. Hence why I had it in previous versions of the draft.</p>
<p>I've never been sure if any of my readers caught the meaning behind that line. The only people I'm absolutely sure know about it are the ones I've told. I'm looking forward to seeing if anyone can figure it out themselves.</p>

